<title>USA: U.S. refinery utilization hits 100.4 pct - EIA.</title>
<headline>U.S. refinery utilization hits 100.4 pct - EIA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Energy Information Administration said U.S. refining utilization rose to 100.4 percent in the week ended May 30.</p>
<p>For the four week period ended on May 30, U.S. refineries were operating at an average of 99.5 percent utilization, the EIA said.</p>
